    "detailed_description": "<strong>SUPERVERSE</strong> is a fast-paced, action-packed, space shooter game. This electrifying arcade transports the player to an ancient network of interconnected universes, to find a way to return to the past and prevent the extinction of humanity.<br><br>The player can only count on his own instincts, reflexes, speed, destructive power of his weapons, and shield to protect himself while taking care to avoid enemy spaceships, asteroids, explosions, and dangerous particles around him.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/2f31c2b42ec40804f944627b2cb50088.poster.avif?t=1753958381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/2f31c2b42ec40804f944627b2cb50088.webm?t=1753958381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/2f31c2b42ec40804f944627b2cb50088.mp4?t=1753958381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In SUPERVERSE you will experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traveling through wormholes and discovering new worlds<br></li><li>Becoming an Artificial Intelligence yourself<br></li><li>Fighting against top-notch AI-driven enemy spaceships and machines<br></li><li>Flying with your favorite spaceship<br></li><li>Enjoying an impressive 3D visual and audio experience<br></li><li>Playing with friends in co-op multiplayer, both locally and remotely, <br>or playing in a single-player mode</li></ul><br><i>SUPERVERSE can be played on <strong>Windows</strong> and <strong>Linux</strong>\u00b9.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>SUPERVERSE</strong> is a fast-paced, action-packed, space shooter game. This electrifying arcade transports the player to an ancient network of interconnected universes, to find a way to return to the past and prevent the extinction of humanity.<br><br>The player can only count on his own instincts, reflexes, speed, destructive power of his weapons, and shield to protect himself while taking care to avoid enemy spaceships, asteroids, explosions, and dangerous particles around him.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/2f31c2b42ec40804f944627b2cb50088.poster.avif?t=1753958381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/2f31c2b42ec40804f944627b2cb50088.webm?t=1753958381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/2f31c2b42ec40804f944627b2cb50088.mp4?t=1753958381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In SUPERVERSE you will experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traveling through wormholes and discovering new worlds<br></li><li>Becoming an Artificial Intelligence yourself<br></li><li>Fighting against top-notch AI-driven enemy spaceships and machines<br></li><li>Flying with your favorite spaceship<br></li><li>Enjoying an impressive 3D visual and audio experience<br></li><li>Playing with friends in co-op multiplayer, both locally and remotely, <br>or playing in a single-player mode</li></ul><br><i>SUPERVERSE can be played on <strong>Windows</strong> and <strong>Linux</strong>\u00b9.</i>",
